        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Steel or Aluminum Frame High Security Mortise Hookbolt Lock Sets for Sliding Store Front Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sliding Store Front Door High Security Mortise Deadbolt Lockset contains everything you need in one kit. The hookbolt mortise lock body is designed for sliding aluminum or steel framed doors. A huge, five-ply, laminated steel bolt that has concealed hardened steel pin provides maximum security. The kit also includes a Mul-T-Lock cylinder. Mul-T-Lock's cylindrical locks are designed to provide superior door protection with unmatchable key control. The key card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated; it saves time and money by making sure only you can make duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: 31/32\", 1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Non handed, easily reversible</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate: Width - 1\", Length - 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: Width - 7/8\",  Length -  6\", Depth (specific to backset) - 1.63\" through 1.78\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Width - 5/8\", Throw - 15/16”</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis complete mortise deadbolt set with Bump Proof Mul-T-Lock cylinders is available in <b>Single Cylinder</b> (keyed lock outside with thumbturn inside) or <b>Double Cylinder</b> (keyed lock on both the outside and inside). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>TH1102-PMSC:</b> - High Security Single Cylinder Mortise Deadbolt Set\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/high-security-store-front-door-1-inch-mortise-cylinder-mul-t-lock-206sp-mor0c01-26\">Mul-T-Lock High Security Cylinder Lock</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-cylinder-brass-thumbturn-th1100-bt\">Solid Brass Thumbturn</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-security-guard\">Cylinder Security Guard</a></li> \r\n<li>3/16\" Spacer/Trim Ring</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\">Hookbolt Mortise Deadbolt Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-hookbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp6-10\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>TH1102-PMDC:</b>  - High Security Double Cylinder Mortise Deadbolt Set \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/high-security-store-front-door-1-inch-mortise-cylinder-mul-t-lock-206sp-mor0c01-26\">Pair of Mul-T-Lock High Security Cylinder Locks, Keyed Alike</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-security-guard\">Cylinder Security Guard</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\">Hookbolt Mortise Deadbolt Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-hookbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp6-10\">Flat Face Plate</a></li> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish for trim. Note: The Mul-T-Lock Cylinders are Brushed Chrome finish. When ordering more than 1 set, you can have them Keyed Differently or Keyed Alike (same key for all sets).\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sliding Store Front Door High Security Mortise Hookbolt Lockset, Mul-T-Lock Cylinders, TH1102-PM",
